        {
          "panel": "N6-01",
          "text": "Fourth morning. After the collection run.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-01",
          "text": "The bindery, after closing?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-01",
          "text": "ArenI\u2019ll be there.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-02",
          "text": "Your answer is on its way.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-03",
          "text": "The loft. I\u2019ll be here most days.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-04",
          "text": "The public stair is clear all the way to this door.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-05",
          "text": "Lower Post can keep my returns. Collections here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-06",
          "text": "We can name these two stops. The rest will need its own visit.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-07",
          "text": "Office of Route Closures.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-08",
          "text": "The current direction, and the two approaches I\u2019ve seen.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-09",
          "text": "Until this office replaces it, Ninth Store must use it.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-10",
          "text": "For these two stops, route through Lower Post. Effective on receipt.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-11",
          "text": "I\u2019ll take it to Toma.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-13",
          "text": "The replacement direction.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-14",
          "text": "I\u2019ll use this direction for those stops.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-15",
          "text": "For Lower Post\u2019s next round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-16",
          "text": "At the upper goods landing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-17",
          "text": "I\u2019ll take the stair with you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-18",
          "text": "Tomorrow\u2019s Bell Basin round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-19",
          "text": "After closing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-19",
          "text": "Come up.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-22",
          "text": "Weekly rent. Use the side stair whenever you need it.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-23",
          "text": "ArenI want to finish the week before I promise.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-23",
          "text": "VennI understand.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-24",
          "text": "I want the quiet. I\u2019m not used to it.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-24",
          "text": "KivaYou know where to find me.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-25",
          "text": "Fifth morning. After the paid Lower Post round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-25",
          "text": "Ilen, on the new round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-27",
          "text": "On the regular round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-28",
          "text": "The next paper order.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-29",
          "text": "I can start this today.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-30",
          "text": "Sixth morning. After the paid collection.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-30",
          "text": "Kiva\u2019s care-of reply. From the buyer.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-32",
          "text": "From your buyer.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-33",
          "text": "They kept me on the order.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-34",
          "text": "Next market day. After the morning post?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-34",
          "text": "ArenAfter the morning post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-36",
          "text": "Seventh morning. The round complete.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-36",
          "text": "Your first week\u2019s done.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-37",
          "text": "Shall we talk about our room?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-37",
          "text": "ArenI\u2019ve chosen the bindery.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-38",
          "text": "I can sleep there and still make the first round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-38",
          "text": "OssaYou\u2019ll have a place at this table.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-39",
          "text": "Later that day.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-40",
          "text": "The week\u2019s rent, as agreed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-41",
          "text": "The room is yours for the week.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-42",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N6-47",
          "text": "Come in.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
